-a-smart-ring\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[\"Ultrahuman announces its App Store ‘PowerPlugs’ with the World’s First AFib Detection Technology on a Smart Ring\",\" ↗\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"https://vision.ultrahuman.com/developer-docs\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-mute\",\"children\":\"05\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"break-words font-medium underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-brand-violet\",\"href\":\"https://vision.ultrahuman.com/developer-docs\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[\"Ultrahuman Vision: The Interface to Your Bio-Data Cosmos\",\" ↗\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2133022/000119312526381855/d119865ds1.htm\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-mute\",\"children\":\"06\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"break-words font-medium underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-brand-violet\",\"href\":\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2133022/000119312526381855/d119865ds1.htm\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[\"www.sec.gov\",\" ↗\"]}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 rounded-2xl bg-mist px-5 py-4 text-sm leading-6 text-mute\",\"children\":[\"This story builds on reporting from\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-ink underline underline-offset-4\",\"href\":\"https://www.therundown.ai/articles/apple-vision-pro-scrubs-into-surgery\",\"children\":\"The Rundown newsletter\"}],\" on September 4, 2026\",\".\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1d:[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-6 lg:sticky lg:top-24\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-3xl border border-line bg-mist p-6 lg:p-7\",\"aria-label\":\"Newsletter signup\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-violet\",\"children\":\"The daily rundown\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Stay ahead of what’s next.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-6 mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-mute\",\"children\":\"The AI news that matters, explained in a few minutes. Get The Rundown in your inbox.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"compact\":true,\"utmSource\":\"news_article\",\"buttonLabel\":\"Sign up\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-xs text-mute\",\"children\":\"Free to join. Unsubscribe anytime.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-3xl bg-gradient-dark p-6 text-paper lg:p-7\",\"aria-label\":\"University signup\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/brand/rundown-university.png\",\"alt\":\"The Rundown University\",\"width\":244,\"height\":24,\"className\":\"h-auto w-52 max-w-full\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-7 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Put the news to work.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/70\",\"children\":\"Build practical AI skills with step-by-step guides, courses, and expert-led workshops.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://app.therundown.ai/checkout/membership?offerKey=monthly_29_no_trial\",\"className\":\"mt-6 flex justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-brand px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold transition hover:opacity-90\",\"children\":[\"Join AI University\",\" \",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":\"↗\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"prefetch\":false,\"href\":\"/ai-university\",\"className\":\"mt-4 block text-center text-xs font-semibold text-white/70 underline underline-offset-4\",\"children\":\"Explore the University\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"In this article\",\"className\":\"hidden border-t border-line pt-6 lg:block\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-mute\",\"children\":\"In this article\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"section-2\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#section-2\",\"className\":\"text-sm font-medium text-ink/70 hover:text-brand-violet\",\"children\":\"What Ultrahuman is building\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"section-7\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#section-7\",\"className\":\"text-sm font-medium text-ink/70 hover:text-brand-violet\",\"children\":\"Why it matters\"}]}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"20:[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"2024 PowerPlugs announcement\"}]]\n21:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\" described applications built around health data and access to sensor streams. The new ambition extends that relationship into control. Developers would need a documented path from a ring gesture to an app action, along with clear compatibility requirements, before they could build dependable experiences around it.\"}]\n22:[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Qualcomm’s involvement gives Ultrahuman a major chip partner for that effort. More processing on the ring could expand what it can do, but the partnership alone leaves important engineering questions open. Continuous interaction would have to fit within a small wearable’s power budget while delivering dependable recognition and response times. A demonstration of a complete task would help establish which work happens on the ring, a phone, or in the cloud. The announced plans do not yet specify where any AI model would run.\"}]]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"p\",\"11\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Permissions would also become part of the experience. Ultrahuman’s \"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://vision.ultrahuman.com/developer-docs\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"developer documentation, reviewed September 6\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\", describes authenticated access to health metrics and requires authorization through its app to access another user’s data. A controller platform would need similarly clear boundaries around device actions. People considering a ring as a car key or gesture controller would need to understand how commands are authorized and how accidental actions are prevented.\"}]]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"The competitive context gives this expansion commercial significance. Oura’s \"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2133022/000119312526381855/d119865ds1.htm\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"September 3 IPO registration statement\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\" disclosed about $1.2 billion in unaudited revenue for the nine months ended June 30, 2026. That covers October 2025 through June 2026 and measures a different period and basis from Ultrahuman’s annualized revenue rate. As Oura prepares for an IPO, Ultrahuman is pursuing an additional reason for customers to choose its ring. Whether controls provide that advantage depends on useful integrations, reliable operation, and demand for commands delivered from a finger.\"}]]}]\n"])</script></body></html>